OL,3,GNEWSAFive arrests after boy, 13,
OL,4,Astabbed on seafront
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been arrested after a
OL,7,F13-year-old boy was seriously injured
OL,8,Fin a stabbing in East Sussex, police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to Grand
OL,12,FParade in Eastbourne, near the
OL,13,Fjunctions of Elms Avenue and Cavendish
OL,14,FPlace, at about 17:10 BST on Saturday.
OL,16,FSussex Police said a boy aged 13 had
OL,17,Fsustained an injury consistent with a
OL,18,Fstabbing, and been airlifted to
OL,19,Fhospital. He has since been discharged,
OL,20,Fthe force said.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
