OL,3,GNEWSAFive arrests after boy, 13,
OL,4,Astabbed on seafront
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree boys, two aged 16 and one
OL,7,F17-year-old, a woman aged 22 and a
OL,8,F20-year-old man were arrested on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of assault occasioning
OL,10,Fgrievous bodily harm and remain in
OL,11,Fcustody, police said.
